# Golgari Grave-Troll: "This creature enters with a +1/+1 counter on it for each creature card in your graveyard" (CR 614.1c,
# 122.6) and "{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from this creature: Regenerate this creature" (CR 701.19a). Its turn 3 dredge mills
# two Ornithoppers among four Forests, so it enters as a 2/2 when cast from hand (it is not in the graveyard as it enters).
# Bot1 pays {1} and a counter for a regeneration shield, leaving a 1/1; Bot2's Lightning Bolt deals it lethal damage and the
# shield regenerates it (CR 701.19b): it stays, tapped, with the damage removed and the one counter it had left.

